{"input": "What did the group talk about the evaluations on the increasing suicide crimes during the COVID-19 and the long-term special care for the pregnant women?", "answers": ["Lynne Neagle pointed out that due to the outbreak of the pandemic, more people reported depression and committed suicide. To deal with the harsh problem, they might have to carry out a review over the accidental mortality through the period. At the same time, Vaughan Gething suggested that even if most public services were shut down, the mental care, especially the perinatal mental health service, could not be stopped, just in order to support the vulnerable people."], "length": 10511, "dataset": "qmsum", "pred": "The group discussed the evaluations on the increasing suicide crimes during the COVID-19 and the long-term special care for the pregnant women. They talked about the need for a comprehensive assessment of the impact of the pandemic on the mental health and well-being of children and young people. They also discussed the importance of providing consistent perinatal support for all women across Wales, especially during the pandemic."}
{"input": "Summarize the whole meeting.", "answers": ["The group mainly talked about the extra deciding of the product at this meeting including the presentation of the prototype assessment, the discussion of the requirements and trends of marketing and the product cost and quotation. Firstly, the Industrial Designer introduced the prototype of the product. It had not only the round basic shape which was made of hard plastics and titanium using different colors, but also the buttons like channel and volumn. Later, the group discussed some details and changes of redesigning the logo, buttons and screens. Next, the Marketing Expert mentioned the exterior of the product, the material attraction, and how easy it was to learn or use the basic functions of the product. Besides, the group discussed some details of the cost of components and made the product cheaper by replacing the titanium by hard plastics with similar color. They finally got an estimate of fourteen point one Euros, which was above the budget. In the end, they discussed the distinction between the product and other devices, and celebrated the completion of the project."], "length": 10663, "dataset": "qmsum", "pred": "The meeting discussed the design and presentation of a product, including the layout, colors, and features. The project manager presented the notes and decisions made during the meeting, and the industrial designer and user interface designer presented their design. The project manager discussed the costs and financing of the project, and the team evaluated the product based on various criteria."}
